#
# The contributor roster is not fully documented yet. Add further named people
# as `given-names` / `family-names` entries above the team entity entry as they
# are confirmed on the About page.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NeuroTrailblazers material in teaching, training or research, please cite it as below."
title: "NeuroTrailblazers: an open curriculum for nanoscale connectomics"
abstract: >-
  NeuroTrailblazers is an open curriculum and mentorship platform for nanoscale
  connectomics: nine technical units, 25 curriculum modules, a reference content
  library, learning tracks, and facilitator material. It is developed in the
  context of the HI-MC (MouseConnects) project (NIH BRAIN CONNECTS, UM1NS132250),
  where IC3 and APEX organize and expose the science and NeuroTrailblazers organizes
  the learning.
type: software
authors:
