    value: "https://neurotrailblazers.org"
    description: "The NeuroTrailblazers site."
  - type: other
    value: "UM1NS132250"
    description: "NIH BRAIN CONNECTS award: HI-MC, A Center for High-throughput Integrative Mouse Connectomics — the project NeuroTrailblazers belongs to."
  - type: other
